  "quirks": [
    "Category chips are a filter over one grid, not separate pages; 전체 lists all 25 items in category order (라멘, 덮밥, 사이드, 음료, 세트).",
    "Sides and drinks have no popup: one tap adds 1 to the cart and a short toast appears. Tapping again adds 1 more to the same line.",
    "면 익힘 has no default. Pressing 담기 without it shows a native alert '면 익힘 정도를 선택해 주세요.' (also in set STEP 1).",
    "Each topping has its own −/+ stepper (0-3). Pressing + at 3 shows a native alert; there is no overall topping limit.",
    "In quantity option groups in this key, an option id is listed once per unit (['chashu','chashu'] = 차슈 ×2). Topping prices are per unit and are multiplied by the cart line quantity.",
    "밥 양 defaults to 보통 (preselected); 곱빼기 is +1,000원.",
    "Set prices are a bundle price; upcharges (+500/+1,000/+1,500/+3,000원) are shown on each choice card. Toppings cannot be added to set ramen. 츠케멘 is not offered in sets.",
    "The two sets have different side lists: 기본 세트 (교자/에다마메 free, 가라아게 +1,000원), 든든 세트 (가라아게/미니 차슈덮밥, both free).",
    "Adding an identical configuration again merges into the existing cart line (qty +1); a different firmness or topping count makes a new line.",
    "Cart − at quantity 1 removes the line with no confirmation. Max 9 per line (native alert beyond that).",
    "전체 취소 opens an in-page confirmation popup (아니요 / 모두 취소); with an empty cart it shows a native alert instead.",
    "주문하기 with an empty cart shows a native alert '메뉴를 먼저 선택해 주세요.'",
    "Sold-out cards (츠케멘, 타코야키) are greyed with a 품절 stamp; tapping one shows a native alert.",
    "처음으로 in the menu header clears the cart (asks first if the cart is not empty).",
    "Dine choice (매장/포장) does not change any price.",
    "Card text merges in the DOM (e.g. '🍜돈코츠 라멘진한 돼지뼈 육수9,500원')."
  ]
